   "text": "<div><div class=\"module-row\">\n\t\t                                            <b><!-- 155.1 -->Start Here - Installation Guide</b>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"Start Here - Installation Guide_pdf\" aria-label=\"&lt;!-- 155.1 --&gt;Start Here - Installation Guide_pdf  &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd6/cpd60065.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"&lt;!-- 155.1 --&gt;Start Here - Installation Guide_pdf\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">PDF</a>\n\t\t                                            <p>This document will assist you with product unpacking, installation and setup.<br><br><strong>See this notice for an important product update.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/other/4146508_eai_cd_removal_no_efsp.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></strong></p>\n\t\t                                        </div>\n<strong>See this notice for an important product update.&nbsp;<a href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/other/4146508_eai_cd_removal_no_efsp.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">PDF</a></strong>\n<div class=\"module-row\">\n\t\t                                            <b><!--255.1 -->User's Guide</b>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"User's Guide_html\" aria-label=\"&lt;!--255.1 --&gt;User's Guide_html &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd6/cpd60271/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"&lt;!--255.1 --&gt;User\" s=\"\" guide_html'=\"\" data-sku=\"SPT_C11CJ66202\" data-element_type=\"txt\">HTML</a>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"User's Guide_pdf\" aria-label=\"&lt;!--255.1 --&gt;User's Guide_pdf  &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd6/cpd60271.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"&lt;!--255.1 --&gt;User\" s=\"\" guide_pdf'=\"\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">PDF</a>\n\t\t                                            <p>This document contains an overview of the product, specifications, basic and in-depth usage instructions, and information on using options.</p>\n\t\t                                        </div>\n<div class=\"module-row\">\n\t\t                                            <b><!--701.1 -->Warranty Statement - for Purchases on or After October 1, 2024</b>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"Warranty Statement - for Purchases on or After October 1, 2024_pdf\" aria-label=\"&lt;!--701.1 --&gt;Warranty Statement - for Purchases on or After October 1, 2024_pdf  &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd6/cpd64738.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"&lt;!--701.1 --&gt;Warranty Statement - for Purchases on or After October 1, 2024_pdf\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">PDF</a>\n\t\t                                            <p>This document describes Epson's limited warranty for this product. This warranty has been updated and is only valid for products purchased on or after October 1, 2024.</p>\n\t\t                                        </div>\n<div class=\"module-row\">\n\t\t                                            <b><!--750.1 -->Declaration of Conformity and Warranty - for Purchases Before October 1, 2024, or for Special Edition Products Purchased at a Club Store</b>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"Declaration of Conformity and Warranty - for Purchases Before October 1, 2024, or for Special Edition Products Purchased at a Club Store_pdf\" aria-label=\"&lt;!--750.1 --&gt;Declaration of Conformity and Warranty - for Purchases Before October 1, 2024, or for Special Edition Products Purchased at a Club Store_pdf  &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd6/cpd60058.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"&lt;!--750.1 --&gt;Declaration of Conformity and Warranty - for Purchases Before October 1, 2024, or for Special Edition Products Purchased at a Club Store_pdf\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">PDF</a>\n\t\t                                            <p>This document declares that this product has met all relevant requirements of the product safety directives and your Epson America, Inc. Limited Warranty.</p>\n\t\t                                        </div>\n<div class=\"module-row\">\n\t\t                                            <b>Supplemental / Late Breaking Information</b>\n\t\t                                            <a title=\"Supplemental / Late Breaking Information_pdf\" aria-label=\"Supplemental / Late Breaking Information_pdf  &nbsp;opens in a new window\" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/docid/cpd6/cpd65213.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"Supplemental / Late Breaking Information_pdf\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">PDF</a>\n\t\t                                            <p>This document provides complementary or late-breaking information to supplement your product documentation.</p>\n\t\t                                        </div>\n<li class=\"sds-item\">\n                                    <h5 class=\"hdg-label\">\n                                       Part Number: &nbsp;T522120-S</h5>\n                                    <div>\n                                       Black&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                                       <a title=\" BlackPDF\n                                          \" aria-label=\"BlackPDF\n                                          &nbsp;\n                                          opens in a new window\n                                          \" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/pdf/msds/t5/t522120.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"Black\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">\n                                          PDF</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                 </li>\n<li class=\"sds-item\">\n                                    <h5 class=\"hdg-label\">\n                                       Part Number: &nbsp;T522220-S</h5>\n                                    <div>\n                                       Cyan&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                                       <a title=\" CyanPDF\n                                          \" aria-label=\"CyanPDF\n                                          &nbsp;\n                                          opens in a new window\n                                          \" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/pdf/msds/t5/t522220.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"Cyan\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">\n                                          PDF</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                 </li>\n<li class=\"sds-item\">\n                                    <h5 class=\"hdg-label\">\n                                       Part Number: &nbsp;T522320-S</h5>\n                                    <div>\n                                       Magenta&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                                       <a title=\" MagentaPDF\n                                          \" aria-label=\"MagentaPDF\n                                          &nbsp;\n                                          opens in a new window\n                                          \" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/pdf/msds/t5/t522320.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"Magenta\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">\n                                          PDF</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                 </li>\n<li class=\"sds-item\">\n                                    <h5 class=\"hdg-label\">\n                                       Part Number: &nbsp;T522420-S</h5>\n                                    <div>\n                                       Yellow&nbsp;|&nbsp;\n                                       <a title=\" YellowPDF\n                                          \" aria-label=\"YellowPDF\n                                          &nbsp;\n                                          opens in a new window\n                                          \" class=\"version-link\" href=\"https://files.support.epson.com/pdf/msds/t5/t522420.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" data-label_text_1=\"Yellow\" data-element_type=\"txt\" data-action=\"download\">\n                                          PDF</a>\n                                    </div>\n                                 </li></div>"
